{
"Items.Spellblade.Desc": "Forged not by a swordsmith, but by a sorceress, this arcane-infused blade amplifies any effects applied to it. Unlike the wizard staves it is based on, this weapon also has a sharp edge, a technological innovation which has proven historically useful in battle."
